# WinServeAI

Infrastructure product: Windows-native local AI server. Stable, small surface area, backend-agnostic.

## Architecture

```
UI → Server Manager (packages/launcher) → Backend trait → concrete backend
```

- UI must not import `winserve-llama` or know llama.cpp flags
- Process ownership only via Server Manager
- Config is human-readable YAML; no raw backend flags

## MVP excludes

Chat UI, model downloads, HuggingFace, agents, RAG, MCP, Docker, auth, metrics dashboards, remote management.

## Skills

Canonical path: `.agents/skills/` (agent-agnostic). Do not copy skills into per-agent folders.

## Docs

Read `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/vision.md` before structural changes.
